{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action Roguelite</h2><br>Risk the Dark is a real-time action roguelite where you play as a survivor struggling to escape formidable darkness.<br>With the interplay of light and dark, various heavy and survival mechanics come together to create an immersive and challenging experience.<br>Explore the shadows, grow in strength, and find the exit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Isolated in the Darkness</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/extras/c8fe39ce040ae63a88cdf8acb8f872ba.avif?t=1769163680\" width=800 height=532 /></span><br><br>After the 'Tearing', the monsters emerged. During the struggle, a thrown grenade left you stranded in an unknown cave.<br>Alive but shaken, you discover that you are not alone.<br>Risk the Dark to survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Light and Darkness</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/extras/0ec5e98e42cf0135d008584f933519e8.poster.avif?t=1769163680\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/extras/0ec5e98e42cf0135d008584f933519e8.webm?t=1769163680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/extras/0ec5e98e42cf0135d008584f933519e8.mp4?t=1769163680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the smothering darkness, create light sources to serve as your eyes. Using these resources, illuminate your path and dispel the gloom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Combat Styles</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/extras/a1aca6eb796f300078e39bb0bde460eb.poster.avif?t=1769163680\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/extras/a1aca6eb796f300078e39bb0bde460eb.webm?t=1769163680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/extras/a1aca6eb796f300078e39bb0bde460eb.mp4?t=1769163680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enhance and complement your build to get the most out of your journey.<br>With melee, ranged attacks, throwables, and elemental combat options, mix and match to create a diverse play style.<br>Use equipment, modding, consumables, and accessories, as well as the skill mastery system to support your decision.<br>With the right set of skills, you will show them that it doesn\u2019t take a hero to Risk the Dark.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Boss Fights</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/extras/bb3d32e9decb6ba1aa945904801110f8.poster.avif?t=1769163680\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/extras/bb3d32e9decb6ba1aa945904801110f8.webm?t=1769163680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/extras/bb3d32e9decb6ba1aa945904801110f8.mp4?t=1769163680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At the end of each area, you will face an especially fearsome foe.<br>Evade their attacks and strike their weak points to take them down and prove that you are not an easy target.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3094800?t=1769163680","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769163680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094800/0221918df4265d7bce5178ca5b65978efb55d538/capsu